{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>GAMEPLAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The most badass, trash-talking, and streamable online multiplayer fighting game of all time, where you can kick your friend's or your favorite idol's ass. It's not just about throwing punches, but also insults and smack talk.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3138400/extras/JENNY_15.gif?t=1742730817\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>SPECIALS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Forget about the usual specials! Here, every character has one more badass than the last. From diamonds and stacks of cash raining down from the sky to evil androids causing chaos. Show who's boss with a special so brutal that even your streaming followers will want to high-five you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3138400/extras/ESPECIAL_LOLO_15.gif?t=1742730817\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>CUSTOMIZATIONS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Not satisfied with the basics? Choose your character, their skin, intro, celebration, and even the trash talk you throw at your opponent. The stage? You pick it! The music? Totally up to you! Every fight is <strong>100% yours</strong>. <strong>You\u2019re the boss here, buddy!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3138400/extras/SKIN_PAPI.gif?t=1742730817\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3138400?t=1742730817","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3138400/5836245e0c29fdde800833e539a0c02a50bde88